#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/background_color.rst:4
msgid "背景颜色"
msgstr "background color"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/background_color.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/background_color.rst:9
msgid ""
"背景颜色模块用于在图像中用指定颜色覆盖所有检测到的区域**以外**的区域，从而突出显示检测目标。该模块可以帮助用户聚焦关注检测到的对象，隐藏背景干扰信息。"
msgstr ""
"The background color module is used to highlight the detection target by "
"covering all detected areas** except** with the specified color in the "
"image.This module can help users focus on detected objects and hide "
"background interference information."

